000369       copy "wspyhrs.cob"   replacing LEADING ==PY-Pay== by ==WS-Pay==
000370                                      LEADING ==Hrs==    by ==WS-Hrs==.
000001C *>*******************************************
000002C *>                                          *
000003C *>  Record Definition For Pay Transactions  *
000004C *>           File                           *
000005C *>     Uses Hrs-Key of Emp-No/Hrs-Code as   *
000006C *>                        key               *
000007C *>*******************************************
000008C *>  File size 24 bytes each.
000009C *>
000010C *> 28/10/25 vbc - Created.
000011C *> 07.04.26 vbc - Chg rate to 99 and moved 2 below Emp-No
000012C *>                creating a new key. It is ASSUMED that there is NO
000013C *>                need for more than one entry for a given Trans Code.
000014C *>                OK, will need to have another field for hrs-Serial that
000015C *>                starts at zero AND same size for the header added.
000016C *>                Size increased from 20 to 24 (units).
000017C *>
000018C  01 WS-Pay-Transactions-Record.
000019C      03 WS-Hrs-Key.
000020C          05 WS-Hrs-Emp-No pic 9(7).
000021C          05 WS-Hrs-Trans-Code pic 99.
000022C          05 WS-Hrs-Rate redefines WS-Hrs-Trans-Code
000023C                              pic 99.        *> Temporary in case used in error
000024C      03 WS-Hrs-Effective-Date pic 9(8).*> ccyymmdd
000025C      03 WS-Hrs-Units pic s9(5)v99 comp-3.
000026C  *> 03 WS-Hrs-Deleted pic x.*> not really NEEDED ???
000027C      03  filler              pic xx.        *> filled to 24 bytes
000028C *>
000029C *> 14 bytes + filler of 6 = 20 to match. the next rec may not be needed ?
000030C *>
000031C  01 WS-Pay-Header-Record.
000032C      03 WS-Hrs-Head-Key pic 9(9).*> Always value zero.
000033C      03 WS-Hrs-No-Recs binary-short unsigned.
000034C      03 WS-Hrs-Batch-No binary-short unsigned.
000035C      03 WS-Hrs-Proof-No binary-short unsigned.
000036C      03 WS-Hrs-Proofed pic x.*> Space or N and Y for proofed
000037C      03  filler              pic x(8).      *> filled to 24 bytes
000038C *>
000371  *>
000372  *>  might be needed
000373  *>
000374   copy "wsfnctn.cob".
000001C *>**********************************
000002C *>                                 *
000003C *>  File Access Control Functions  *
000004C *>                                 *
000005C *>**********************************
